    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Trillionaire is a game about becoming a trillionaire. You are a seemingly normal person, but how will that break your fragile human mind when you are earning billions each second and realize madness is closer than your dreams of a trillion? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/b60210a917208398ec82524d2a53bcea.poster.avif?t=1743706248\" width=800 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/b60210a917208398ec82524d2a53bcea.webm?t=1743706248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/b60210a917208398ec82524d2a53bcea.mp4?t=1743706248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Play Idle Trillionaire:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/f1f8c4ea6c33f2409d57a0bbbc3f8dcc.avif?t=1743706248\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige Up after getting the Global Domination Card &gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/ab8ad15c5a833e1c7f4e94faa8375091.avif?t=1743706248\" data-has-big width=800 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to prestige many times to &quot;Break the Universe&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/2865772bfb189f68c4a49418761841ee.avif?t=1743706248\" data-has-big width=800 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now in 11 Languages! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/ff9d9865fa63cb096d51284c5b43af5d.avif?t=1743706248\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete to have more money than other players at the 1 year mark and other milestones! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage the prestige system that unlocks cards and increases the time rate on subsequent play throughs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the achievement goals faster than your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Trillionaire is a game about becoming a trillionaire. You are a seemingly normal person, but how will that break your fragile human mind when you are earning billions each second and realize madness is closer than your dreams of a trillion? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/b60210a917208398ec82524d2a53bcea.poster.avif?t=1743706248\" width=800 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/b60210a917208398ec82524d2a53bcea.webm?t=1743706248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/b60210a917208398ec82524d2a53bcea.mp4?t=1743706248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to Play Idle Trillionaire:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/f1f8c4ea6c33f2409d57a0bbbc3f8dcc.avif?t=1743706248\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige Up after getting the Global Domination Card &gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/ab8ad15c5a833e1c7f4e94faa8375091.avif?t=1743706248\" data-has-big width=800 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to prestige many times to &quot;Break the Universe&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/2865772bfb189f68c4a49418761841ee.avif?t=1743706248\" data-has-big width=800 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now in 11 Languages! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753100/extras/ff9d9865fa63cb096d51284c5b43af5d.avif?t=1743706248\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete to have more money than other players at the 1 year mark and other milestones! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage the prestige system that unlocks cards and increases the time rate on subsequent play throughs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the achievement goals faster than your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
